QuestGuidance.Register("en",363,{
[11585]="700551E1\n1\tSorrowful shades can be found throughout the Circle of Despair. Dornach has asked you to try comforting the sorrowful spirits of Minas Morgul so they might reveal the fate which befell them. NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.\t\n2\tTalk to Dornach\tDornach can be found in the Circle of Despair. You have tried to comfort the sorrowful spirits of Minas Morgul. You should talk to Dornach. NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.\n",
[11586]="70026190\n1\tPour the Ent-tears into the pool\030Find the pool at the top of the Even-rills\tThe pool is at the peak of the Even-rills, north-east of the Eavespires. Erchiel asked you to venture to the topmost pool of the Even-rills and pour some Ent-tears within it to purify the waters.\n2\tTalk to Erchiel at the Eavespires\tErchiel is at the Eavespires, south-west of the Even-rills. Erchiel will be pleased to hear the tears have purified the water.\n",
[11587]="70053396\n1\tExamine gladdens near the Gladden Falls ([see journal]/8)\tGladdens can be found throughout the Gladden Fields, but Radagast is especially interested in those that have grown near the Gladden Falls. Radagast is concerned something has befouled the waters of the Gladden. You should examine gladdens near the Gladden Falls and see if they show any signs of corruption.\n2\tExamine gladdens near the Gladden Falls (7/8)\tGladdens can be found throughout the Gladden Fields, but Radagast is especially interested in those that have grown near the Gladden Falls. Radagast is concerned something has befouled the waters of the Gladden. You should examine gladdens near the Gladden Falls and see if they show any signs of corruption.\n3\tFill Radagast's phial with water from the Gladden Falls\tThe Gladden Falls can be found in the western reaches of the Gladden Fields. Radagast has asked you to fill a phial with water from the Gladden Falls in the hope that it might help him identify and cleanse the blight creeping into the Gladden Fields.\n4\tDeliver the phial of water to the sparrow\tThe sparrow can be found near the Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields. You have found many blighted gladdens, but it appears that not all of them have succumbed. You also filled a phial with water from the Gladden Falls and you should bring it to the sparrow.\n",
[11588]="7000701C\n1\tDeliver the book to Asikko\030Collect Asikko's book\tAsikko's book is hidden somewhere in the camp of the traitorous Rauta-lehmä faction in Nan Amlug, east of the camp of the Suuri-lehmä. Asikko is hesitant to go himself to retrieve the book of lore from the Rauta-lehmä for fear of provoking war too soon. Instead, he has asked you to retrieve the book for him.\n2\tTalk to Gondranc\030Collect Asikko's Book\tGondranc awaits your return at Esteldín. You successfully recovered Asikko's book from the camp of the Rauta-lehmä. The Earth-kin chieftain has asked you to deliver it to Gondanc, fulfilling his promise to the Ranger.\n",
[11589]="7004E496\n1\tDefeat prowling battle-cats in Ironfold (total: 6)\tProwling battle-cats can be found roaming outside Utterby in the Ironfold. You have encountered a number of prowling battle-cats and should defeat them.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many prowling battle-cats.\n",
[11590]="70000DE8\n1\tTalk to Bounder Chubb\tBounder Chubb can be found on the south side of Needlehole. Filibert Bolger, angered by the death of his cow, has asked you to speak with Bounder Chubb about the incident.\n",
[11591]="7001F4B0\n1\tDefeat Temair the Devoted\tTemair can be found before the entrances to the Arboretum and Fortress within the area of Garth Agarwen. Arienh asked that you bring the leader of the Créoth, a terrible woman named Temair, to justice. She preaches within the confines of Garth Agarwen.\n2\tReturn to Arienh\tReturn to Arienh at her encampment at the entrance to Garth Agarwen. Temair was found exactly where Arienh told you she would be. Dispatching Temair proved simple enough and you should now return to Arienh.\n",
[11592]="7006E117\n1\tInvestigate Dhórgruth\t\n2\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.\n3\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.\n",
[11593]="7006E119\n1\tInvestigate Dhórgruth\t\n2\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.\n3\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.\n",
[11594]="7006E118\n1\tInvestigate Dhórgruth\t\n2\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.\n3\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.\n",
[11595]="7006DD43\n1\tDefeat Azagath Sea-shadow within the Inner Sanctum\tYou must defeat Azagath and stop him from awakening the creature Gârash.\n2\tSurvive the impending attack\tAzagath fled deeper into the inner sanctum. Your pursuit, cut short by fell magic, leaves you with a feeling of unease. Something is amiss. You must survive. The clamour of battle can be heard in corridors beyond.\n3\tStop Azagath from achieving his goal\tThe ambush is cleared and the door into the deepest part of the sanctum opens. You must proceed deeper, find Azagath and defeat him before he unleashes -- Gârash.\n4\tDefeat the Alad defending Gârash Do not let the Aladi approach Glorfindel or Gandalf\tAzagath's ambition led to his demise before an ancient Morgothian horror. You must stand against this darkness and assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in containing Gârash, the Emptiness and its servants.\n5\tSurvive against Gârash, the Emptiness, and seal it within its sarcophagus\tGârash, the Emptiness begins to swell with power, feeding on the remains of Azagath. Assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in keeping Gârash from leaving the Temple of Utug-bûr.\n",
[11596]="7006DD47\n1\tDefeat Azagath Sea-shadow within the Inner Sanctum\tYou must defeat Azagath and stop him from awakening the creature Gârash.\n2\tSurvive the impending attack\tAzagath fled deeper into the inner sanctum. Your pursuit, cut short by fell magic, leaves you with a feeling of unease. Something is amiss. You must survive. The clamour of battle can be heard in corridors beyond.\n3\tStop Azagath from achieving his goal\tThe ambush is cleared and the door into the deepest part of the sanctum opens. You must proceed deeper, find Azagath and defeat him before he unleashes -- Gârash.\n4\tDefeat the Alad defending Gârash Do not let the Aladi approach Glorfindel or Gandalf\tAzagath's ambition led to his demise before an ancient Morgothian horror. You must stand against this darkness and assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in containing Gârash, the Emptiness and its servants.\n5\tSurvive against Gârash, the Emptiness, and seal it within its sarcophagus\tGârash, the Emptiness begins to swell with power, feeding on the remains of Azagath. Assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in keeping Gârash from leaving the Temple of Utug-bûr.\n",
[11597]="7006DD48\n1\tDefeat Azagath Sea-shadow within the Inner Sanctum\tYou must defeat Azagath and stop him from awakening the creature Gârash.\n2\tSurvive the impending attack\tAzagath fled deeper into the inner sanctum. Your pursuit, cut short by fell magic, leaves you with a feeling of unease. Something is amiss. You must survive. The clamour of battle can be heard in corridors beyond.\n3\tStop Azagath from achieving his goal\tThe ambush is cleared and the door into the deepest part of the sanctum opens. You must proceed deeper, find Azagath and defeat him before he unleashes -- Gârash.\n4\tDefeat the Alad defending Gârash Do not let the Aladi approach Glorfindel or Gandalf\tAzagath's ambition led to his demise before an ancient Morgothian horror. You must stand against this darkness and assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in containing Gârash, the Emptiness and its servants.\n5\tSurvive against Gârash, the Emptiness, and seal it within its sarcophagus\tGârash, the Emptiness begins to swell with power, feeding on the remains of Azagath. Assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in keeping Gârash from leaving the Temple of Utug-bûr.\n",
[11598]="7006E01A\n1\tInvestigate deeper into Thûr Hin, Lair of the Children Legolas must not falter\tInvestigate Thûr Hin and seek out the two Utûgi ahead.\n2\tListen to Khablag and Daikhag\tListen to Khablag and Daikhag.\n3\tDefeat Khablag Legolas must not falter\tDefeat Khablag.\n4\tListen to Khablag and Legolas\tListen to Khablag and Legolas.\n5\tHeal Legolas! Legolas must not falter All Elven Menders must not falter\tHeal Legolas.\n6\tHeal Legolas and fend off Daikhag Legolas must not falter All Elven Menders must not falter\tHeal Legolas and fend off Daikhag.\n7\tDefeat Daikhag\tDefeat Daikhag.\n8\tPress deeper into Thûr Hin\tPress deeper into Thûr Hin.\n9\tListen to Kormoltur, Lord of Terror\tListen to Kormoltur, Lord of Terror.\n10\tAttack Kormoltur\tAttack Kormoltur.\n11\tDefeat the Utûgi\tDefeat the Utûgi.\n12\tDefeat Kormoltur, Lord of Terror\tDefeat Kormoltur, Lord of Terror.\n",
